OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 DEC
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland in Song
OL,5,     GMusic knows many different forms
OL,6,     Gin Scotland, as a result of her
OL,7,     Gradically different traditions.
OL,8,     GPoet Kenneth Steven looks at the
OL,9,     Glives and music of five Scottish
OL,10,     Gcomposers.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GTo begin her week on Flowers,
OL,19,     Ganaiis chooses to give her first
OL,20,     Gbouquet to an innovative UK
OL,21,     Gsaxophonist, flautist and
OL,22,     Gcomposer.
